  "description": "Experience effortless commuting and leisurely rides with the Biktrix Swift Lite Step-Thru 3 electric bike. With its powerful motor and convenient design, this eBike is perfect for city streets and paved paths. Here's what sets it apart:\nFeatures:\n\n350W motor for quick acceleration and easy cruising\nVarious levels of pedal-assist for customizable riding experiences\nStep-thru design for easy mounting and dismounting\nThree different wheel sizes to accommodate riders of all heights\nComes standard with color display, kickstand, rear rack, front and tail lights, and fenders\n\nBenefits:\n\nEffortlessly commute to work or explore your city without breaking a sweat\nEnjoy a comfortable ride with convenient features like pedal-assist and step-thru design\nChoose from a variety of colors to match your personal style\nSuitable for riders of all heights, ensuring a perfect fit for everyone\nUpgrade options available to customize your ride for maximum comfort and convenience\n\nDon't miss out on the opportunity to revolutionize your daily commute and weekend adventures.",
